	skos:definition "The thirteen predicate types the in-toto project lists as vetted at release v1.2.0, each with the predicate_type a statement of it carries at the version its page describes." ;
	skos:inScheme in_toto_linkml:in_toto_predicates ;
	skos:note "The in-toto project's own types are CURIEs under in_toto. The others are full addresses, because the Python generator writes no namespace for a prefix that only an enum's meaning uses." ;
